# Build context for the root Dockerfile (Fly.io fallback host, see
# docs/ai-handoff/FLY-DEPLOY.md). Only what a service build reads goes to the
# builder: manifests, lockfile, TypeScript sources and the web app's assets.

# Secrets never enter a build context or an image layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
.cq-secrets

# Installed and generated output; the image installs and builds its own.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/blob-report
**/out

# Not read by any service build.
.git
.github
.claude
.railway
docs
design
capital-q-audit
supabase
tests
infra
scripts/*
!scripts/deploy
scripts/deploy/fly-deploy.mjs
render.yaml
deploy
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
